      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This procurement policy note assists in enabling open book contract management to be used in a fair way depending on the risk level and complexity of the contract. This will ensure it is used on those contracts where the additional cost is justified by the level of benefits and risk.",
